 "steps": [
  {
   "id": "s0",
   "title": "Condition",
   "text": "We need \\( H = R \\), so the path is as **tall** as it is **wide**.",
   "actions": []
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Write both",
   "text": "\\( \\dfrac{v_i^2\\sin^2\\theta}{2g} = \\dfrac{v_i^2\\sin2\\theta}{g} = \\dfrac{v_i^2(2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta)}{g} \\).",
   "actions": []
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Simplify",
   "text": "Cancel \\( v_i^2/g \\): \\( \\dfrac{\\sin^2\\theta}{2} = 2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta \\). Divide by \\( \\sin\\theta \\): \\( \\dfrac{\\sin\\theta}{2} = 2\\cos\\theta \\), so \\( \\tan\\theta = 4 \\).",
   "actions": []
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "title": "Answer",
   "text": "\\( \\theta = \\tan^{-1}4 = 76^\\circ \\) (75.96°).",
   "actions": []
  }
 ],
